I’m unable to make live API calls from this environment, but here’s how you would retrieve the information and what the trimmed‑down response would look like:

**Request you’d send**

```
GET https://www.virustotal.com/api/v3/domains/example.org/related?limit=10&cursor=abc&relationship_type=subdomains
Authorization: Bearer my_api
```

